{"schema_version":1,"type":"work","title":"智囊二十","authors":[{"name":"馮夢龍","role":"撰","entity_id":"hixhd2h9be2q"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"千頃堂書目","source_bid":"d59f2mel8d1c","title_info":"馮夢龍智囊二十","author_info":"缺","summary":"馮夢龍智囊二十⟨缺⟩"}],"description":{"text":"馮夢龍撰。見著錄於《千頃堂書目》。其著錄之文，《千頃堂書目》作「馮夢龍智囊二十」。本書惟《千頃堂書目》一志著錄，別無他證。《千頃堂書目》清黃虞稷撰——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["千頃堂書目"]},"period_upper":"qing","period_upper_basis":"catalog_bound：唯一著錄源《千頃堂書目》成書於清初（黃虞稷 1629-1691），故不晚於 qing；書內小注無朝代線索，period 留 null 不猜","id":"d59f6emste6f","revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","resources":[{"name":"维基文库","type":"text","id":"wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%BA%E5%9B%8A"}],"has_text":true,"_path":"Work/e/6/f/d59f6emste6f-智囊二十.json","_isDraft":false}